{"_id":"1ZdgJWCnraWoNewl","name":"Unraveler","type":"npc","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e/art/unraveler.webp","items":[{"_id":"LGTUujai3GBh35A7","name":"Darkvision","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Darkvision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"darkvision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.qCCLZhnp2HhP3Ex6","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"IgRnYJiHLHl1mjKw","name":"Entropy Lore","type":"lore","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/lore.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"mod":{"value":16},"proficient":{"value":0}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Yrje5Nur6pmzq2kc","name":"Starskin","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An unraveler constantly sheds dim light in a 40-foot radius, shining like starlight.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light","occult"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"3dYD2gUUemq3Bc0q","name":"Voidflight","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The unraveler is on the Astral Plane, Limbo, or in vacuum (such as outer space);</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The unraveler travels long distances at an unimaginable speed. While using Voidflight, an unraveler can reach nearby worlds in [[/r 2d12 #hours]]{2d12 hours}, nearby solar systems in [[/r 2d4 #days]]{2d4 days}, or other regions of space in [[/r 2d6 #weeks]]{2d6 weeks}. On the Astral Plane or Limbo, an unraveler can reach any location with which it is familiar in just [[/r 1d10 #hours]]{1d10 hours}.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","move"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"Tw8Xfx8h7x61FiC6","name":"+1 Status to All Saves vs Transmutation","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","predicate":[],"selector":"saving-throw","type":"status","value":1}],"slug":"1-status-to-all-saves-vs-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kquBnQ0kObZztnBc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"vVZgJ0QfaC32bdai","name":"Entropic Reprisal","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The unraveler is damaged by a melee weapon;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The wielder of the triggering weapon must attempt a @Check[type:reflex|dc:22|name:Entropic Reprisal DC|traits:damaging-effect,chaotic,magical,occult|showDC:gm]{Reflex} saving throw. On a failure, the triggering weapon is affected by Unravel.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"U6NMiIuJADdHATjk","name":"120 Feet Fly Speed in Astral Plane, Limbo, or vacuum","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"fly-speed","value":80,"predicate":[{"or":["terrain:astral-plane","terrain:limbo","terrain:vacuum"]}]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"xZcm3NXMDeIGUj6l","name":"Unravel","type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Creatures or objects hit by an unraveler's Entropic Reprisal or unraveling lash Strike begin to physically fall apart at the seams like frayed rope. A creature or object affected by unravel takes [[/r 2d8[persistent,slashing]]] damage.</p>\n<p>As long as a creature is taking this persistent damage (\"unraveling\"), it is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}. A creature wielding an unraveling weapon takes a -1 penalty to attack rolls, and a creature wearing unraveling armor reduces the armor's item bonus to AC by 1 (to a minimum of +0). An unraveling object makes a flat check each round, just like a creature, to stop the persistent damage.</p>\n<p>An unraveler can cast <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.dINQzhqGmIsqGMUY]{Mending}</em> on any unraveling object or creature to immediately end the persistent damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.6N02ZatqQAZIrqug]{Effect: Unravel (Weapon)}</p>\n<p>@Compendium[battlezoo-bestiary-pf2e.pf2e-battlezoo-bestiary-effects.BOTRJ3ZSpEf7relk]{Effect: Unravel (Armor)}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["magical","occult"],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"mBCCg8SdydZC0cxw","name":"Unraveling Lash","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"y37aqGXnTJ37Psd0":{"damage":"1d6+8","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"4jMBC3H8loezi0gN":{"damage":"1d6","damageType":"spirit"}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":["unravel"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1721532633973,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"7KnlVVwNtocCKoED","name":"Entropic Ray","type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["magical","range-increment-100"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"cOwLOfC2YT2HHpvI":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"spirit"}},"bonus":{"value":17},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":1721532718311,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"h7lXdakUR5im2Ciw","name":"Occult Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":16,"dc":24,"mod":0},"tradition":{"value":"occult"},"prepared":{"value":"innate","flexible":false},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":0},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":3,"max":3},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":1,"max":1},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":true},"displayLevels":{}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"GDrRBuUQAfTRoBl5","name":"Plane Shift (Astral Plane, Material Plane, and Limbo only)","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/plane-shift.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You and your allies traverse the barriers between planes of existence. The targets move to another plane, such as the Plane of Fire, the Shadow Plane, or the Abyss. You must have specific knowledge of the destination plane and use a magic tuning fork created from material from that plane as a focus for the spell. While the tuning forks for most prominent planes are uncommon, just like the spell plane shift, more obscure planes and demiplanes often have rare tuning forks. The spell is highly imprecise, and you appear 1d20x25 miles from the last place one of the targets (of your choice) was located the last time that target traveled to the plane. If it's the first time traveling to a particular plane for all targets, you appear at a random location on the plane. Plane shift doesn't provide a means of return travel, though casting plane shift again allows you to return to your previous plane unless there are extenuating circumstances.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"plane-shift","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","teleportation"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 willing creature, or up to 8 willing creatures joining hands"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"10 minutes"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"h7lXdakUR5im2Ciw","heightenedLevel":7},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{}}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.5bTt2CvYHPvaR7QQ","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"xw17dqKMdgSsFzby","name":"Know Direction","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/know-direction.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>In your mind's eye, you see a path northward. You immediately know which direction is north (if it exists at your current location).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> You can instead know the direction to a familiar location, such as a previous home or a favorite tavern.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"know-direction","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"h7lXdakUR5im2Ciw"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.tXa5vOu5giBNCjdR","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"wWJdUdBkrmwE5CTa","name":"Detect Magic","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-50000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the level of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"value":30,"type":"emanation"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"h7lXdakUR5im2Ciw"},"counteraction":false},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"ooKcu0zT38euVruw","name":"Mage Hand","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/mage-hand.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a single magical hand, either invisible or ghostlike, that grasps the target object and moves it slowly up to 20 feet. Because you're levitating the object, you can move it in any direction. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move the object an additional 20 feet. If the object is in the air when the spell ends, the object falls.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet, and you can target an unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mage-hand","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 unattended object of light Bulk or less"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"h7lXdakUR5im2Ciw"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 1 or less"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 unattended object with a Bulk of 2 or less"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"ownership":{"default":0,"bWA8khYkEWvh0G5V":3},"_stats":{"systemId":null,"systemVersion":null,"coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":null,"modifiedTime":null,"lastModifiedBy":null,"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.pwzdSlJgYqN7bs2w","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"_id":"8v7XINaFvf2tddn7","name":"Dancing Lights","type":"spell","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dancing-lights.webp","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":-100000,"flags":{"core":{}},"system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create up to four floating lights, no two of which are more than 10 feet apart. Each sheds light like a torch. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move any number of lights up to 60 feet. Each light must remain within 120 feet of you and within 10 feet of all others, or it winks out.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dancing-lights","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.819,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"ti